{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2020-05-04 10:30:00', 'title': 'Wabtec Reports First Quarter 2020 Results', 'text': 'WABTEC REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.Q1 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.97.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.58.Q1 SALES $1.9 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $2.03 BILLION.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.97 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.WABTEC IS WITHDRAWING ITS 2020 FINANCIAL GUIDANCE AT THIS TIME.TAKING ACTIONS TO REDUCE WORKING CAPITAL & TO CUT NON-ESSENTIAL CAPITAL SPENDING.AT THIS TIME, A MAJORITY OF OPERATIONS, INCLUDING THOSE IN UNITED STATES, CONTINUE TO OPERATE.OPERATIONS MOST NOTABLY IN CHINA, INDIA, AND PARTS OF EUROPE WERE PARTIALLY/FULLY IMPACTED DUE TO LOCKDOWNS.REMAINS CONFIDENT IN LONG-TERM FUNDAMENTALS.AT MARCH 31, COMPANY HAD CASH AND CASH EQUIVALENTS OF $616 MILLION AND DEBT OF $4.7 BILLION.WABTEC - AT MARCH 31, TOTAL, MULTI-YEAR BACKLOG WAS $21.5 BILLION, AND 12-MONTH BACKLOG WAS $5.6 BILLION, SLIGHTLY LOWER THAN AT DECEMBER 31, 2019.'}
